{"sequence":13,"at":"2026-10-02T13:57:28.132Z","kind":"server-message","message":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"result\":{\"workId\":\"bridge-clocktower\",\"number\":1,\"revision\":1,\"title\":\"门前\",\"body\":\"林澈站在钟楼门外，把工具箱放在脚边。昨夜停下的钟没有再响，他伸手推了一次门，门板纹丝不动。\\n\\n周伯提着钥匙从街角走来。林澈收回手，说明师父让他来查看停钟。周伯点了点头，把钥匙插进锁孔。\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"workRevision\":1,\"origin\":\"human\",\"taskId\":null,\"threadId\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T13:57:27.912Z\",\"previousRevisions\":[],\"reviewNote\":null}}"}],"structuredContent":{"result":{"workId":"bridge-clocktower","number":1,"revision":1,"title":"门前","body":"林澈站在钟楼门外，把工具箱放在脚边。昨夜停下的钟没有再响，他伸手推了一次门，门板纹丝不动。\n\n周伯提着钥匙从街角走来。林澈收回手，说明师父让他来查看停钟。周伯点了点头，把钥匙插进锁孔。","status":"draft","workRevision":1,"origin":"human","taskId":null,"threadId":null,"updatedAt":"2026-10-02T13:57:27.912Z","previousRevisions":[],"reviewNote":null}}}}}
